'' RUN: std/outcome -- a failed Result's Value( ) raises at the caller's line with its message.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/result-caller-line.tiko -o tests/codegen/resultcallerline.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/resultcallerline.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: Aborting due to runtime error 1 (illegal function call) at line 5 of
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: result-caller-line.tiko(), Value( ) of a failed Result
